MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2095101996}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92b5b6357c7c0ab44a023db23ae9dabb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: Narrator
    nameExtra:
    - Narrator
    - Gleebnar
    - 
    - Narrator
    - Gleebnar
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - Narrator
    - 
    - 
    - 
    sentences:
    - 'You wake up to the sound of TV Static blaring throughout your room. You may
      have just woken up, but you swear you could make out a voice in the static. '
    - "Curious, you listen closer, but the voice is intelligible. Ah. Oh, well. You
      reach down to grab your remote and turn the television off, when\u2026"
    - "\u2026THAT\u2019S RIGHT, EVEN YOU CAN WIN BIG! BIG MONEY! CASH, DOUGH, MOOLAH,
      BIGGER THAN YOU\u2019VE EVER WON BEFORE! "
    - THE ENTIRE GLEEBNAR FORTUNE, ALL YOURS TO KEEP! BUT IT COMES AT A COST!
    - "Well, if the giant, booming voice that was now blasting out of your TV at
      full volume wasn\u2019t enough to keep your attention\u2026that sure did."
    - "PAY REAL CLOSE ATTENTION, OR YOU\u2019LL LOSE OUT GUARANTEED. "
    - 'I, TOM GLEEBNAR, AM HOSTING A FULL WEEK-LONG GAMBLING EXTRAORDINAIRE,  '
    - THE LIKES OF WHICH UNSEEN IN ANY CORNER OF THIS SIDE OF THE GALAXY!
    - 'SEVEN DAYS, SEVEN CHANCES TO GET THE HIGHEST SCORE AMONGST ALL OF YOUR PEERS! '
    - 'ONE VERY LUCKY CONTESTANT WILL WIN IT ALL AS THE HIGHEST SCORE AMONG YOU, '
    - "NOT ONLY WINNING THE GLEEBNAR FORTUNE\u2026BUT THE RIGHTS TO THE CASINO ITSELF
      AS WELL!"
    - 'You feel yourself waking up from the anticipation.  '
    - The Gleebnar Fortune, on top of the rights to the notorious Lucky 7 casino?
      This could be your chance to get everything you deserve!
    - "You pack your bags, gather up your courage, and head to the\u2026"
